waycheck (1.6.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release
    - Update upstream protocol list to v1.41
    - Add COSMIC A11y and AT-SPI protocols
    - Add ChromeOS aura-output-management protocol
    - Add Gamescope reshade protocol
    - Add Treeland protocols
    - Correct identifiers of KDE virtual desktop and external brightness
      protocols
    - Expand default window width to show all tabs
    - Become compliant with REUSE v3.3

